{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">挪威將於下周三為已故國王哈拉爾五世舉行國葬，大批官員及議員鞠躬致敬。國家主席習近平稱，高度重視中挪關係發展。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.NOR.FUNERAL-0130.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026GBBgQZrajf1788397276.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NOR.FUNERAL-0130.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在首都奧斯陸的王宮主教座堂，哈拉爾五世的靈柩以皇室旗幟覆蓋，上面擺放國王的冠冕與配劍。旁邊展示著哈拉爾五世生前使用過的皇權配飾。多名政府官員當地周三逐一向已故國王鞠躬致敬。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.NOR.FUNERAL-0130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ivjIpyT1X01788397281.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NOR.FUNERAL-0130_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家主席習近平同日致電挪威新國王哈康八世，表示中方願同新國王一道努力，書寫中挪友好交往新篇章。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">哈拉爾五世在上周五病逝，終年89歲，目前靈柩供公眾人士瞻仰，本月9日在奧斯陸舉行國葬。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T02:03:55.790122+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}